<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
    <title>{{branding.domain}} - Sign In or Create Account</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Readex+Pro:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/core/fonts.css?v={{css_version}}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-bundle.css?v={{css_version}}">
</head>
<body class="sp-auth-light">
    <main class="sp-auth-page">
        <div class="sp-auth-info">
            <div>
                <div class="sp-auth-badge">Dynapps &middot; Internal AI Gateway</div>
                <h2 class="sp-section__title">Welcome</h2>
                <p>
                    This is Dynapps' internal AI gateway. Sign in with your
                    Dynapps work account through single sign-on. No passwords are created
                    or stored here.
                </p>

                <details class="sp-auth-more">
                <summary>How sign-in works, recovery, and enterprise options</summary>
                <hr class="sp-auth-divider">

                <h2 class="sp-section__title">Getting Started</h2>
                <div class="sp-auth-flow-steps">
                    <div class="sp-auth-flow-step"><span class="sp-step-num">1</span><span>Sign in with your Dynapps work account (single sign-on)</span></div>
                    <div class="sp-auth-flow-step"><span class="sp-step-num">2</span><span>Download the desktop bridge for <a href="/files/downloads/dynapps-bridge-windows.exe">Windows</a>, or <a href="/files/downloads/dynapps-bridge-linux-x86_64.tar.gz">Linux</a></span></div>
                    <div class="sp-auth-flow-step"><span class="sp-step-num">3</span><span>Approve the device link &mdash; the bridge installs your Cowork profile and syncs your skills</span></div>
                    <div class="sp-auth-flow-step"><span class="sp-step-num">4</span><span>Use Dynapps skills and tools directly inside your AI tools</span></div>
                </div>

                <hr class="sp-auth-divider">

                <h2 class="sp-section__title">How Sign-In Works</h2>
                <p>Single sign-on is the only way in. It hands you to Dynapps' corporate
                    login (Microsoft Entra ID) and back. Your Entra ID groups decide what you can
                    reach here, and they are re-read every time you sign in, so a group added
                    or removed in Entra ID takes effect at your next sign-in.</p>

                <hr class="sp-auth-divider">

                <h2 class="sp-section__title">Trouble Signing In?</h2>
                <p>
                    Sign-in is handled entirely by Dynapps' corporate directory (Microsoft Entra ID). If it
                    refuses you, or you reach this page with an error, contact the platform
                    team &mdash; there is no separate account here to recover.
                </p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sp-auth-form-col">
            <div class="sp-login-container sp-login-container--bare">
                <div class="sp-card">
                    <div class="sp-login-logo">
                        <img src="/files/images/logo.svg" alt="{{branding.domain}}" height="40" class="sp-logo-light">
                        <img src="/files/images/logo-white.svg" alt="{{branding.domain}}" height="40" class="sp-logo-dark">
                    </div>

                    <div id="pane-signin">
                        <p class="sp-login-subtitle">Sign in</p>

                        <div id="error" class="sp-login-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

                        {{#if sso_saml_enabled}}
                        <div class="sp-form-actions">
                            <a id="sso-btn" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-u-w-full" href="/admin/auth/adfs/start{{#if redirect_encoded}}?redirect={{redirect_encoded}}{{/if}}">Sign in with Dynapps SSO (Microsoft Entra ID)</a>
                        </div>
                        {{/if}}
                        {{#if sso_oidc_enabled}}
                        <div class="sp-form-actions">
                            <a id="sso-oidc-btn" class="sp-btn {{#if sso_saml_enabled}}sp-btn--secondary{{else}}sp-btn--primary{{/if}} sp-u-w-full" href="/admin/auth/entra/start{{#if redirect_encoded}}?redirect={{redirect_encoded}}{{/if}}">Sign in with Microsoft</a>
                        </div>
                        {{/if}}
                        {{#if sso_saml_enabled}}
                        <p class="sp-login-switch">Your Dynapps Entra ID account is the only sign-in.</p>
                        {{else if sso_oidc_enabled}}
                        <p class="sp-login-switch">Your Dynapps Entra ID account is the only sign-in.</p>
                        {{else}}
                        <p class="sp-login-switch">Single sign-on is not configured on this instance. Contact the platform team.</p>
                        {{/if}}
                        {{#if dev_login_enabled}}
                        <p class="sp-login-switch">Development instance: run <code>just dev-login &lt;user&gt;</code> and open the printed link.</p>
                        {{/if}}

                        <div id="loading" class="sp-login-loading" hidden aria-live="polite">
                            <div class="sp-login-spinner" role="status" aria-label="Loading"></div>
                            <p id="loading-text">Processing...</p>
                        </div>

                        <div id="retry" class="sp-login-retry" hidden>
                            <a href="/admin/login">Try again</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script data-cfasync="false" src="/js/pages/admin-login.js?v={{css_version}}" type="module"></script>

</body>
</html>
